      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The key to evaluating any patient in the emergency department is to remember to keep an open differential when taking the history and conducting the physical examination. Many of the unusual conditions and complications of gynecologic diseases or procedures discussed in this article can be diagnosed with a careful and complete gynecologic history and examination."},
